# Walk(curvature) parametric motion space from the multi-cycle walk family
# (the BVH walk clips sharing one skeleton: walkCurve / walkMoreCurve /
# walkTightCurve). Parameter = turn tightness (0 = widest authored curve,
# 1 = tightest). Clips are multi-cycle; consumers should normalize them to
# one gait cycle (--cycle-joint LeftAnkle) so contact structures match.
node walk 1
registration walk LeftAnkle LeftAnkle,RightAnkle 3 1
parameter_metric walk turn_rate
example walk 0.0 ../BVH/walkCurve.bvh
example walk 0.5 ../BVH/walkMoreCurve.bvh
example walk 1.0 ../BVH/walkTightCurve.bvh
edge walk walk
# Thresholds calibrated for D6's asymmetric windows and raw weighted squared
# sum. Values are specific to this 31-joint corpus and five-frame window.
edge_config walk walk 225 250 12 60 7
